    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινηνέω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινέω</span> (B), only in
			impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heap</i>
			or <i>pile upon</i>, c. gen. loci, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκροὺς πυρκαϊῆς ἐπενήνεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.428
				</span></i>
			; perh. to be read in <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>. (Fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νήεον</span>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηέω</span>.)</div>
